        {
          "comments": "NOT REVIEWED — raw running config supplied for manual review; no automated pass, finding, or applicability decision asserted.",
          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 92b03138bac022b1f2b4e7d9befc64bcbf4a341a2c69f573cb2d172e209eb668\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: be7b76e01ac1552507d597bc518d3f8e7b15b5dd161c599fed26853b3dad2bcf\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the router with an export policy avoid global visibility of local multicast (S, G) states. The example below will prevent exporting multicast active sources belonging to the private network.\n\nR8(config)#ip access-list extended OUTBOUND_MSDP_SA_FILTER\nR8(config-ext-nacl)#deny ip 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255 any\nR8(config-ext-nacl)#permit ip any any\nR8(config-ext-nacl)#exit\nR8(config)#ip msdp sa-filter in x.1.28.2 list OUTBOUND_MSDP_SA_FILTER",
          "group_id": "V-216636",
          "group_id_src": "V-216636",
          "group_title": "SRG-NET-000018-RTR-000008",
          "rule_id": "SV-216636r1137902_rule",
          "rule_id_src": "SV-216636r1137902_rule",
